+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
| Running ${PKGSTEM} on OpenBSD
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

veil reads ${SYSCONFDIR}/veil/config.toml. The default one serves
${TRUEPREFIX}/share/veil/www on http://127.0.0.1:8080/, drops privileges to
_veil and restricts itself with pledge(2) and unveil(2).

    # rcctl enable veil
    # rcctl start veil
    $ curl http://127.0.0.1:8080/

Edit the configuration and run `rcctl reload veil`.
